#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(2) the restriction in subsection (3) does not apply` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(2) the restriction in subsection (3) does not apply` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
