#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(3) working tax credit is not payable to the person for the day` (JUST TRUE) `s 120(2) TCA test couple Ann and Bob` `s 120(2) TCA test person Bob` `s 120(2) TCA test person Ann` (Date 15 7 2025) `s 120(2) TCA test period` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(3) working tax credit is not payable to the person for the day` (JUST FALSE) `s 120(2) TCA test couple Ann and Bob` `s 120(2) TCA test person Bob` `s 120(2) TCA test person Ann` (Date 15 5 2025) `s 120(2) TCA test period` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5), (6): answered by the Fraud Act's 7(6) and 7(6A)
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(6) the relevant period` (LIST (Date 1 1 2025)) (LIST (Date 2 1 2020)) EQUALS `s 119(7) SSFA 7(6A) the period of three years`
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(6) the relevant period` (LIST (Date 1 1 2025)) EMPTY EQUALS `s 119(7) SSFA 7(6A) the period of 26 weeks`
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(5) the disqualification period` (Date 1 3 2025) (JUST (Date 1 4 2025)) `s 119(7) SSFA 7(6A) the period of 26 weeks` EQUALS JUST (Period WITH `first day` IS Date 1 4 2025, `last day` IS Date 29 9 2025)
-- (7), (8)
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(7) the provision is the appropriate penalty provision` `s 120(2) TCA 36A(2)(a) some other penalty provision` EQUALS FALSE
