#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(7) the benefit is a disqualifying benefit` `child tax credit` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(7) the event is a disqualifying event` `s 120(2) TCA 36A(10) some other event` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(8) the number of disqualifying events in the set of proceedings` 3 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(8) the number of disqualifying events in the set of proceedings` 1 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(8)(a) subsection (1)(b) is satisfied` (LIST (Date 1 1 2025)) (LIST (Date 2 1 2020)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(8)(a) subsection (1)(b) is satisfied` (LIST (Date 1 1 2025)) (LIST (Date 1 1 2020)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(8)(b) the event is taken into account for the purposes of subsection (1)(d)` (LIST FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 120(2) TCA 36C(8)(b) the event is taken into account for the purposes of subsection (1)(d)` (LIST FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
