#ASSERT `s 120(3)(b) TCA 38(1)(ca) an appeal lies against the decision` `s 120(3)(b) TCA 38(1)(ca) a decision under section 36C that working tax credit is not payable, or not payable for a particular period` EQUALS JUST TRUE
